    "description": "**Context**\nVIP sign-ups don't come through the normal agency-website automation — they have to be entered manually by specific Ops team members.\n\n**Requirements**\n\n* Add a \"New\" button back to the Sign-Ups related list on the Player record (previously removed) so users with access can create a sign-up manually.\n* Restrict visibility of this button to a new permission set — not to all Ops/all internal users. Starting group: Joyce + 1 other Ops teammate. Andy and Ali should explicitly NOT get the button for now.\n* Control via permission set at the user level (confirmed approach on the call, not object/profile-level).\n\n**Constraints / Dependencies**\nNone called out.\n\n**Source**\nFathom — WagerTech <> Jumpr Weekly Sync, 09/23/2026 (https://fathom.video/calls/831090060) — Joyce Kiddell \\~54:43–57:28, Kobi Kunasekaran \\~55:14–57:09, Emily Vandenberg \\~56:33. Also Taryn's notes, Joyce VIP > \"Player → Add New button back just for Ops profile... through permission set.\"",
